AMLSim typology attribution
The synthetic generator is an independently implemented Python port of
typology ideas and branches from IBM/AMLSim:
https://github.com/IBM/AMLSim
Copyright IBM Corp. 2017–2026 and AMLSim contributors.
AMLSim is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is included
at licenses/AMLSim-Apache-2.0.txt. The RingSight port replaces the Java simulator
and its configuration pipeline with deterministic Python data generation,
adds graph identifiers, controls, synthetic injections and eval ground truth,
and retains seven AML typology families. It uses no real customer data.

